  "source_review": [
    "The server binds only to the host loopback address and requires its private address.",
    "State changes require the exact local origin and a bounded configuration object.",
    "The server rejects unsupported fields and retains each case in its fixed dataset.",
    "The server verifies the original directive and case hashes before it starts a process.",
    "The server saves the fixed protocol and launch record before it starts a process.",
    "The server permits one active process and creates a separate directory for each experiment.",
    "The child stop guards block later model operations and retries after interruption.",
    "Container cleanup checks full identifiers and the exact experiment label before removal.",
    "Repeated cleanup and a final cleanup check cover containers that appear during shutdown.",
    "A shutdown timeout reports an active process instead of a successful interruption.",
    "The nested packet preview retains an isolated frame and blocks external requests."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The browser checks use a test child process. They establish no model quality result.",
    "The actual Docker check uses real containers and a test child process with zero model calls.",
    "The review proves browser controls and interruption boundaries. It does not complete an experiment with the selected models.",
    "The original case facts, reports, media, and corpus assignments remain unchanged."
  ]
